00:05:41,538 --> 00:05:47,538
Joseph: King of Dreams is a family, animation,
drama film directed by Rob LaDuca.

2
00:11:23,076 --> 00:11:29,076
In this animated retelling of the story from the Bible's Book of Genesis, Joseph's gift of dream
interpretation and his brilliantly colored coat inspires jealousy in his brothers.

3
